      "updated": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "1  volta.node / .nvmrc /\n   .node-version   (major)\n2  engines.node    -> floor\n3  Dockerfile FROM node:N\n4  default 22  (loud warning)\n\nlibc: FROM node:*-alpine -> musl\nelse  -> bookworm-slim",
      "originalText": "1  volta.node / .nvmrc /\n   .node-version   (major)\n2  engines.node    -> floor\n3  Dockerfile FROM node:N\n4  default 22  (loud warning)\n\nlibc: FROM node:*-alpine -> musl\nelse  -> bookworm-slim",
